# the world over simulated days (Day length 30 min): the offices go round, the day turns, the brothers do as they
# do (the novice slips, the old brother sinks flat, the rivals clash, Columba sleeps at Matins), all in the chronicle
tap GLO
spin K1 -2
tap HOME
expect office 1
expect day 1
wait 1800000
expect day 2
expect events >8
expect chron >5
expect slips1 >0
expect flats2 >0
expect clashes3 >0
shot day2.png
# to Matins: Columba nods off sooner or later, and the Amen (or the end) wakes him
office 0
expect day 3
wait 3000
shot matins_bell.png
wait 900000
expect naps5 >0
expect asleep 0
# the days: the novice learns and takes his vows; a new novice comes to the gate; the old brother falls ill and
# comes back (days N: N of the world's daily turns at once)
expect vowed1 0
days 30
expect vowed1 1
expect skill1 >84
expect here6 1
tap ARP
wait 300
shot brothers30.png
tap HOME
days 60
expect here 7
wait 600000
shot later.png
expect day >90
